>I know that the drawbridge might lower for me if I use my
>musical talents, or try to knock.  Problem: I don't have 
>the means to do either.  Any advice?
If you have a ring of levitation, boots of levitation, a blessed potion of
levitation or water walking boots, than you can take the backdoor.
It is not difficult to recognize levitation boots, because they are almost
always cursed (fumbling boots also).

If you have a wand of opening or a spellbook of knock, than you can directly
open the drawbridge.

If you have a music instrument, than you can play master mind.

If this all fails, it becomes harder.
You can dammage the drawbridge with a wand of striking. To cross the pool you
need a wand of cold, a amulet of life saving (I think this will work) or maybe
jumping boots (I never tried this). If you are lucky there is a boulder in the
little maze left from the castle.

Polymorphing yourself can be a solution.

Finally you can search for the tower, you can find there water walking boots
(you need fire-resistance and teleport control), however I never understood
what to do with it. Because the main problem is now the trapdoors! Do you 
read this, development team? Why no levitation boots? And why a stupid
uncursed +0 long sword and not a blessed +8 war hammer named Mjollnir?
The Tower is a heavily guarded place full of JUNK (I defeated Vlad the Impaler,
sat on the throne, a puff of logic, opened the chest, a scroll of destroy
armor)! I expected a princess with a wish!

